	(text "Notes:\n1) U27 decodes only codes 1-4; six outputs unused. \n2) U29's I1a-d tie to +5 V, forcing commands inactive on the alternate mux phase. \n3) U7-D/U7-E form a keeper latch on J1-19; R24 also raises the level for U5-6. \n4) R21/C8 set the strobe at ~6.8 µs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
